      "text": "We can evaluate it as follows \\[ \\begin{align*} (6 \\otimes 4) \\otimes 3 &= \\dfrac{6 + 4}{6 - 4} \\otimes 3 \\\\ &= 5 \\otimes 3 \\\\&= \\dfrac{5 + 3}{5 - 3} \\\\&= 4. \\end{align*} \\]\n\nThus, A is the correct answer.",
